hide empty description

State Idle

Idle --> Pressed : Button pressed
Pressed --> Pressed : Button pressed - wait for long press
Pressed --> Released : Button released - before long press trigger
Pressed --> LongPressed : Button pressed - long pressed triggered
LongPressed --> WaitForRelease
Released --> Released : Button released - wait for double press
Released --> Idle : Button released - wait for double press done
Released --> DoublePressed : Button pressed
DoublePressed --> WaitForRelease
WaitForRelease --> Idle : Button released


@enduml